    "q-80933": {
      "dom_id": "step-q80933",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "$1$ is **not** both even and odd.\n\nExpress the compound statement above in symbolic form given the following:\n\n- $P:1\\text{ is even}$\n\n- $Q:1\\text{ is odd}$",
      "worked_solution": "The given sentence is the negation of the following sentence: \n\n$1$ is both even and odd, \n\nwhich can be expressed symbolically as $P∧Q.$\n\nThe negation is represented by the symbol \"$¬$\". \n\nTherefore, the given sentence is expressed symbolically as $¬(P∧Q).$",
