      "problem": "Simplify the statement $¬(¬(P∧¬Q))∨P.$",
      "worked_solution": "Two negations in a row cancel each other out. So, we can simplify $¬(¬(P∧¬Q))$ to $P∧¬Q.$\n\nTherefore, the given statement can be simplified to\n\n$$\n(P∧¬Q)∨P.\n$$",
